300|||||||&#8221; header_text_color=&#8221;#FFFFFF&#8221; header_font_size=&#8221;60px&#8221; header_2_font_size=&#8221;46px&#8221; header_3_font_size=&#8221;32px&#8221; custom_margin=&#8221;-1px||-6px|||&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;||3px|||&#8221; text_orientation_tablet=&#8221;&#8221; text_orientation_phone=&#8221;center&#8221; text_orientation_last_edited=&#8221;on|phone&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h2>THE CULTURE MATRIX<sup style=\"font-size: 15px;\">TM<\/sup><\/h2>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.22.1&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; text_font=&#8221;GrandSlang-Roman||||||||&#8221; text_font_size=&#8221;30px&#8221; text_line_height=&#8221;1.2em&#8221; custom_margin=&#8221;3px||||false|false&#8221; text_orientation_tablet=&#8221;&#8221; text_orientation_phone=&#8221;center&#8221; text_orientation_last_edited=&#8221;on|phone&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<p>How to curate motivated, aligned and engaged teams.<\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.22.1&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;|2%|54px|6%|false|false&#8221; text_orientation_tablet=&#8221;&#8221; text_orientation_phone=&#8221;center&#8221; text_orientation_last_edited=&#8221;on|phone&#8221; border_width_left=&#8221;2px&#8221; border_color_left=&#8221;#FFFFFF&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]In today\u2019s competitive market, a business needs to have both an appealing brand internally and externally in order to attract A-players, create high-performing teams, and be desirable for their customers.<\/p>\n<p>Building engaged teams and creating a thriving culture isn\u2019t about the free food, fancy parties or beer on tap. It\u2019s about creating a brand people want to be a part of.<\/p>\n<p>Finding top talent and keeping them is one of the biggest challenges and a major cost for many businesses. The Culture Matrix&#x2122; is a framework that helps leaders to create a culture people are drawn to. In today\u2019s world, having an amazing culture is not just a \u2018nice to have\u2019 anymore, it\u2019s a \u2018must-have\u2019.In this session you\u2019ll discover\u2026<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>How to create an environment people want to be a part of and thrive in, no matter where in the world they are located. <\/li>\n<li>How to turn your team members into raving fans and brand ambassadors.<\/li>\n<li> The six keys to building an engaged, aligned and motivated team. <\/li>\n<li>How to attract and retain top talent using brilliant internal and external communication strategies. <\/li>\n<li>A behind-the-scenes look into some of the most impactful cultures.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Culture is an amplifier in business. If the culture isn\u2019t great, everything else is a lot more frustrating too. On the other hand, an outstanding culture makes everything else a lot more effortless and enjoyable. This session is perfect for business leaders, managers and entrepreneurs looking create a word-class culture people are drawn to and want to be a part of.[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][\/et_pb_section][et_pb_section fb_built=&#8221;1&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; use_background_color_gradient=&#8221;on&#8221; background_color_gradient_direction=&#8221;90deg&#8221; background_color_gradient_stops=&#8221;#ffffff 20%|#bbc6c8 20%&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;73px||0px|||&#8221; background_last_edited=&#8221;on|phone&#8221; use_background_color_gradient_phone=&#8221;on&#8221; background_color_gradient_stops_phone=&#8221;#ffffff 0%|#bbc6c8 0%&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_row column_structure=&#8221;2_5,3_5&#8243; use_custom_gutter=&#8221;on&#8221; make_equal=&#8221;on&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; width=&#8221;95%&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;||0px|||&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_column type=&#8221;2_5&#8243; admin_label=&#8221;Column&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; background_enable_image=&#8221;off&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_image src=&#8221;https:\/\/franziskaiseli.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/FI_The-Brand-Alchemy-Method&#x2122;-1-1.jpg&#8221; title_text=&#8221;FI_The Brand Alchemy Method&#x2122; (1)&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][\/et_pb_image][\/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=&#8221;3_5&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.22.1&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; header_font=&#8221;Poppins|300|||||||&#8221; header_text_color=&#8221;#FFFFFF&#8221; header_font_size=&#8221;60px&#8221; header_2_font_size=&#8221;46px&#8221; header_3_font_size=&#8221;32px&#8221; custom_margin=&#8221;-1px||-6px|||&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;||3px|||&#8221; text_orientation_tablet=&#8221;&#8221; text_orientation_phone=&#8221;center&#8221; text_orientation_last_edited=&#8221;on|phone&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h2>THE BRAND ALCHEMY METHOD<sup style=\"font-size: 15px;\">TM<\/sup><\/h2>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; text_font=&#8221;GrandSlang-Roman||||||||&#8221; text_font_size=&#8221;30px&#8221; text_line_height=&#8221;1.2em&#8221; custom_margin=&#8221;3px||||false|false&#8221; text_orientation_tablet=&#8221;&#8221; text_orientation_phone=&#8221;center&#8221; text_orientation_last_edited=&#8221;on|phone&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<p>Transform Your Brand from Invisible to Irresistible<\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.0&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;|2%|59px|6%|false|false&#8221; border_width_left=&#8221;2px&#8221; border_color_left=&#8221;#FFFFFF&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"132\" data-end=\"228\" class=\"\">What makes a brand unforgettable? How do you create a business that becomes the most coveted name in its space \u2014 and sustain it?<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"230\" data-end=\"663\" class=\"\">In a world where consumers are more discerning than ever, building a powerful brand is no longer a choice; it\u2019s a <strong data-start=\"344\" data-end=\"357\">necessity<\/strong>. With the fast-evolving media landscape and shifting consumer behaviors, businesses need to be more than just <strong data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"479\">visible<\/strong> \u2014 they need to be <strong data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"514\">irresistible<\/strong>. Today\u2019s consumers crave brands with a deep sense of <strong data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"603\">purpose, authentic connections,<\/strong> and engaging communication that goes beyond transactions.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"927\" class=\"\">Branding isn\u2019t just about being noticed; it\u2019s about being <strong data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"733\">chosen<\/strong>. While marketing may attract potential customers, <strong data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"826\">branding is what makes them choose you<\/strong>. The strength of your brand determines whether your business thrives or fades into the background.<\/p>\n<p>In this session, you&#8217;ll discover&#8230;<strong data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"972\"><\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1654\">\n<li data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1101\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"1101\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"1007\">The Brand Alchemy Method&#x2122;<\/strong> \u2013 A practical methodology to create a compelling, courageous, and impactful brand strategy.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1183\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1183\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1134\">The ten essential elements<\/strong> of becoming the \u201cgo-to brand\u201d in any industry.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1272\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1272\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1208\">How to leverage AI<\/strong> to craft compelling content aligned with your brand strategy.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1357\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1357\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1323\">How to win the minds and hearts of strangers<\/strong> and turn them into raving fans.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1454\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1454\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1387\">The art of storytelling<\/strong> and how to leverage a bold narrative to captivate your audience.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1568\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1568\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1507\">How to communicate with clarity and confidence<\/strong>, crafting messages that resonate with the right audiences.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1654\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1654\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1593\">Practical examples<\/strong> from Franziska\u2019s own successful, <strong data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1644\">\u201ctattoo-able\u201d<\/strong> brands.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1848\" class=\"\">Join renowned entrepreneur and brand strategist <strong data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1723\">Franziska Iseli<\/strong> as she reveals her proven strategies for building brands that people don\u2019t just recognize \u2014 they want to be <strong data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1845\">a part of<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"2054\" class=\"\">With real-world examples from her own ventures \u2014 two of which have become so iconic that fans have them tattooed \u2014 Franziska will show you how to <strong data-start=\"1996\" data-end=\"2051\">elevate your brand through the art of bold branding<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][\/et_pb_section][et_pb_section fb_built=&#8221;1&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.22.1&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;0px||0px||false|false&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_row _builder_version=&#8221;4.22.1&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; width=&#8221;90%&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;75px|||||&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_column type=&#8221;4_4&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.22.1&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.22.1&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; header_font=&#8221;Poppins|300|||||||&#8221; header_text_color=&#8221;#FFFFFF&#8221; header_font_size=&#8221;60px&#8221; header_2_font_size=&#8221;46px&#8221; header_3_font_size=&#8221;32px&#8221; custom_margin=&#8221;-1px||-6px|||&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;||3px|||&#8221; text_orientation_tablet=&#8221;&#8221; text_orientation_phone=&#8221;center&#8221; text_orientation_last_edited=&#8221;on|phone&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h2>NEXT STEPS<\/h2>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.22.1&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; text_font=&#8221;GrandSlang-Roman||||||||&#8221; text_font_size=&#8221;30px&#8221; text_line_height=&#8221;1.2em&#8221; custom_margin=&#8221;3px||||false|false&#8221; text_orientation_tablet=&#8221;&#8221; text_orientation_phone=&#8221;center&#8221; text_orientation_last_edited=&#8221;on|phone&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<p>Our approach<\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.22.1&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; custom_margin=&#8221;||27px|||&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<p>Franziska ensures every keynote, workshop, and presentation is customized to connect with your audience and delivered in an engaging, energetic, and memorable way.<\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][et_pb_row _builder_version=&#8221;4.22.1&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; width=&#8221;95%&#8221; custom_margin=&#8221;||||false|false&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;0px||0px|||&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_column type=&#8221;4_4&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.22.1&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_code module_class=&#8221;hmsa&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.22.1&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; positioning=&#8221;relative&#8221; custom_margin=&#8221;||||false|false&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;||42px|||&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<div class='white' style='background:rgb(255, 255, 255); border:solid 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border-radius:0px; padding:8px 8px 8px 8px;'>\n<div id='keynotes_slider' class='owl-carousel sa_owl_theme ' data-slider-id='keynotes_slider' style='visibility:hidden;'>\n<div id='keynotes_slider_slide01' class='sa_hover_container' style='padding:5% 5%; margin:0px 0%; background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); '><div style=\"text-align: left;padding-bottom: 10px\">\r\n<div><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/franziskaiseli.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/step-1-1.png\" alt=\"Step 1\" \/><\/div>\r\n<h3>Discovery &amp; Evaluation<\/h3>\r\n<p>We\u2019ll first have a conversation to understand your objectives and make sure we can create the impact you desire. We love raving fans and will be very honest with our assessment of whether we can work together to achieve your desired outcomes.<\/p>\r\n<p>Please email <a href=\"mailto:info@basicbananas.com\">info@basicbananas.com<\/a> or call <a href=\"tel:61299706785\"><strong>+61 2 9970 6785<\/strong><\/a> to book in for an initial call and to check Franziska\u2019s availability.<\/p>\r\n<p>Please note that Franziska travels internationally from Sydney, Australia.<\/p>\r\n<\/div><\/div>\n<div id='keynotes_slider_slide02' class='sa_hover_container' style='padding:5% 5%; margin:0px 0%; background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); '><div style=\"text-align: left;padding-bottom: 10px\">\r\n<div><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/franziskaiseli.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/step-2.png\" alt=\"Step 2\" \/><\/div>\r\n<h3>Research &amp; Insights<\/h3>\r\n<p>Once we\u2019re booked in, we\u2019ll kick off with a conference call with your key stakeholder\/s. On this call we\u2019ll discuss objectives of your event, attending audiences and the experience you\u2019d like to create for a world-class event.<\/p>\r\n<\/div><\/div>\n<div id='keynotes_slider_slide03' class='sa_hover_container' style='padding:5% 5%; margin:0px 0%; background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); '><div style=\"text-align: left;padding-bottom: 10px\">\r\n<div><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/franziskaiseli.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/step-3.png\" alt=\"Step 3\" \/><\/div>\r\n<h3>Customization &amp; Creation<\/h3>\r\n<p>Franziska then creates and customizes the perfect keynote for your audience to get inspired, motivated and ready to take action.<\/p>\r\n<\/div><\/div>\n<div id='keynotes_slider_slide04' class='sa_hover_container' style='padding:5% 5%; margin:0px 0%; background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); '><div style=\"text-align: left;padding-bottom: 10px\">\r\n<div><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/franziskaiseli.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/step-4.png\" alt=\"Step 4\" \/><\/div>\r\n<h3>Presentation &amp; Experience<\/h3>\r\n<p>The result of our preparation and experience is a presentation you and your audiences will love and remember. They\u2019ll walk away with practical insights to fuel their growth, motivated and excited for the future.<\/p>\r\n<\/div><\/div>\n<div id='keynotes_slider_slide05' class='sa_hover_container' sty